      "anchor": "SPHMC arXiv:2609.06906v1 Sections1-3 standing beta=1/alpha=kappa^-1/RGO/smoothing and Section4.1 S4.E1, Lemma4.1 S4.Thmtheorem1, S4.Ex4-6; actual unreflected posterior covariance and source unnormalized V_eta. Primary-first Smoothed_Hessian_lower_source_preread.md.",
      "wording_status": "faithful paraphrase",
      "attribution": "Fan Chen, Sinho Chewi, Jianfeng Lu, Matthew S. Zhang; actual analytic Lemma4.1, source beta1/kappa/eta cap."
    },
    "statement": "For the actual source Gaussian-smoothed unnormalized potential and true RGO posterior, produce probability and vectorL2, covariance upper norma^2/(kappa^-1+eta^-1), C2 regularity and (kappa+eta)^-1*norma^2<=D2V_eta(y)[a,a]<=(1+eta)^-1*norma^2, and true1-Lipschitz gradient. This is the analytic Lemma4.1, not an algorithm/main theorem.",
